    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;be such that the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has repeated root <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to:"
